1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,460
Are you looking down at your screen right now?

2
00:00:04,460 --> 00:00:06,960
A chronic modern illness caused by smartphones —

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:12,260
let's dig into the shocking truth about text neck and how to fix it.

4
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:14,560
When you tilt your head all the way down to 60 degrees,

5
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:18,100
the load on your neck soars to about 27kg.

6
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:22,060
That's like carrying a 7-year-old on the back of your neck all day —

7
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:24,660
an enormous physical strain.

8
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:29,260
But without correcting daily habits, treatment is useless.

9
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:32,120
The Don'ts!

10
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:35,120
Lying down on your phone, or keeping the monitor below eye level

11
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:39,020
and craning your neck like a turtle is an absolute no-no.

12
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:41,620
Now, the Do's you must practice!

13
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:44,320
Set the top of your monitor exactly at eye level,

14
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:47,260
and when using your phone, support your elbow with the other hand

15
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:50,660
and lift the device right up to eye level.

